  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note-1",
      "type": "canvas_note",
      "position": {
        "x": 340,
        "y": -80
      },
      "style": {
        "width": 1100,
        "height": 190
      },
      "data": {
        "label": "Note",
        "params": {
          "text": "**Zero-shot calepinage pipeline**\n\n1. Grounding DINO detects stones via text prompt → boxes_list\n2. SAM segments each box → contours (ordered by id)\n3. DINOv2 classifies each crop by k-NN against your reference images → classes {type:[ids]}\n4. Stone Calepinage crosses contours + classes → colored wall diagram + legend\n\nSETUP: set the Image File path. In DINOv2 set 'Reference Folder' (ImageFolder, subfolders = class names) and press 'Build Refs'. Then press 'Detect' on Grounding DINO.",
          "color_index": 3
        }
      },
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 190,
      "selected": false,
      "dragging": false,
      "resizing": false,
      "positionAbsolute": {
        "x": 340,
        "y": -80
      }
    },
